## Why This Is Asked

Examines ability to design distributed state machines with strong consistency guarantees across services (order, payment, inventory, shipping) using CQRS and event-sourcing. Tests judgment on orchestration vs choreography, failure handling, and testing strategies.

## Key Concepts

- Saga orchestration vs choreography trade-offs
- Event types, commands, compensations
- Idempotency and deduplication in distributed events
- Tenant data isolation and event-sourcing snapshots
- Testing strategies and fault-injection scenarios

